{
  "sequence_id": "seq_f9a4e67ae3c018f6",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "When it's your time to go, make sure you're surrounded by others."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Don't end up like me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Grandpa?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yes? How I may I help you? You?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "MR. ITA- DORI?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "My Grandpa is dead."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Sugisawa Hospital"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Reception"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Registration"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yup, that should be it for the documents."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Okay. Thanks for every- thing."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Are you sure you're okay?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Well, it's kind of my first time experiencing this. It hasn't really sunk in yet..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "My Grandpa would be mad if I moped around..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...so I'll just have to laugh while I burn him up."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "How can you say that?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "YUJ! Itadori, correct?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'm from Jujutsu high school."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Sorry, but there's no time."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Julustsu High School First-Year Megumi FUSHIGURO"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The cursed object you have is extremely dangerous. Hand it over right away."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Who are you? I'm mourn- ING..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "cursed object?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Friend?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "this. You have it, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Oh yeah! I found it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I don't really mind giving it back, but my fellow club members have taken a liking to it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'd at least like an expla- nation."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Nationally, the average number of unexplanned deaths and missing persons exceeds 10,000 annually."
    }
  ],
